 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "games is a list of [score, result] where score is a canonical decimal string of an integer 0..1e9 and result is \"win\" or \"lose\"; threshold is a number in [0, 1]. A candidate threshold s is one of the scores that occur. s is valid when, among the games with score >= s, the proportion lose / total, computed as an IEEE-754 double quotient, is >= threshold. Return the smallest valid s, or -1 when none is valid (including no games).",
